#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2654 lib/html.php:2900
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Momba ny Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Ny Cacti dia natao ho vahaolana feno amin'ny famoronana kisary mifototra amin'ny RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) sy ny rafitra fanamboarana kisary. Ny tanjony dia ny hanamora ny asan'ny Mpitantana tambajotra amin'ny alalan'ny fikarakarana ny antsipiriany manan-danja rehetra ilaina mba hamoronana Kisary misy dikany."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Jereo azafady ny %stranonkala ofisialin'ny Cacti%s raha mila fanazavana momba ny fampiasana ny Cacti, ny fanohanana, ary ny fanavaozana."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Mpamolavola mavitrika"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Mpamolavola miasa amin'ny Cacti, ny rafitr'asany, ny antontan-taratasy fanazavana, ary ny dikan-teny ho avy."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Fankasitrahana manokana"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Mpandray anjara amin'ny antontan-taratasy fanazavana, QA, famonosana rindrankajy, ny Forum, ary ny pejy YouTube-nay."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Mpikambana taloha mendri-kaja"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Mpikambana tao amin'ny Cacti Group tany am-boalohany izay efa nandroso tamin'ny lalan'asa hafa. Mirary soa hatrany ho azy ireo izahay."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Fisaorana"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Fisaorana manokana ho an'i %sTobi Oetiker%s, mpamorona ny %sRRDtool%s sy ny %sMRTG%s malaza tokoa."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Ny mpampiasa ny Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Indrindra ho an'izay rehetra nanokana fotoana nanao tatitra olana, na nanampy tamin'ny famahana olana mifandraika amin'ny Cacti. Ary koa ho an'izay rehetra nandray anjara tamin'ny fanohanana ny Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lisansa"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Ny Cacti dia eo ambanin'ny lisansa GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Ity rindrankajy ity dia rindrankajy malalaka; azonao zaraina sy/na ovaina araka ny fepetran'ny GNU General Public License navoakan'ny Free Software Foundation; na ny dikan-teny faharoa (version 2) amin'ny Lisansa, na (araka ny safidinao) izay dikan-teny vaovao kokoa."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ity rindrankajy ity dia zaraina amin'ny fanantenana fa hahasoa, saingy TSY MISY ANTOKA NA INONA NA INONA; na dia ny antoka tsy voalaza mivantana momba ny FAHAMENDREHANA ARA-BAROTRA na ny FAHAMENDREHANA AMIN'NY TANJONA MANOKANA aza. Jereo ny GNU General Public License raha mila antsipiriany bebe kokoa."

