#: include/global_form.php:172
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Isa ambony indrindra amin'ny famerenana Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php:173
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Ho an'ny fitaovana SNMPv2 sy SNMPv3, io no haben'ny famerenana ambony indrindra (max-repetitions) amin'ny SNMP Bulk Walk. Ny sanda tsotra dia 'Famantarana ho azy amin'ny famerenana fanondroana'. Ho an'ny switch lehibe dia lehibe, lohamilina avo lenta, tambajotra Jumbo Frame, na fifandraisana WAN manana fahatarana ambony, ny fampitomboana io sanda io dia mety hampitombo ny fahombiazan'ny poller. Angon-drakitra betsaka kokoa no voafono ao anaty fonosana SNMP tokana, izay mety hampihena ny fotoana fanaovana fangatahana angon-drakitra. Na izany aza, ny fitaovana sasany dia mety handà tanteraka tsy hamaly ny fonosana manana habe famerenana ambony loatra. Marina indrindra izany ho an'ny fitaovana karazana IoT kely hery na fitaovana IT madinika tafiditra anaty rafitra. Tokony hojerena manokana ihany koa ny MTU an'ny lalan'ny tambajotra manontolo satria ny fametrahana sanda ambony loatra dia mety hitarika fahatapahan'ny fonosana (fragmentation)."

