#: include/global_settings.php:427
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Fomba fanomezan-dalana ny Kisary"

#: include/global_settings.php:428
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Misy fomba efatra hamaritana ny fahazoan-dalan'ny Mpampiasa amin'ny Kisary. Ny voalohany dia 'Mpandefitra' (Permissive). Eo amin'ny fikirana 'Mpandefitra', ny Mpampiasa dia mila fahafahana miditra amin'ny iray amin'ireto ihany: ny Kisary, ny Fitaovana na ny Lasitra Kisary mba hahazoana miditra amin'ireo Kisary mifandraika aminy. Eo amin'ny 'Hentitra' (Restrictive), ny Mpampiasa dia tsy maintsy manana fahafahana miditra amin'ny Kisary, ny Fitaovana, ary ny Lasitra Kisary mba hahazoana miditra amin'ilay Kisary. Ireo fomba roa voalohany ireo dia manana olana amin'ny fahafahana mitombo ho an'ny fametrahana tena lehibe. Noho izany, misy safidy roa fanampiny azo ampiasaina. Ireo dia 'Mifototra amin'ny Fitaovana', izay midika fa raha manana fahafahana miditra amin'ny Fitaovana ianao dia mahazo miditra amin'ireo Kisariny. Ary farany ny 'Mifototra amin'ny Lasitra Kisary', izay midika fa raha manana fahafahana miditra amin'ny 'Lasitra Kisary' ianao dia mahazo miditra amin'ny Kisarin'ny Fitaovana rehetra mampiasa io Lasitra io."

#: include/global_settings.php:432
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Mpandefitra"

#: include/global_settings.php:433
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Hentitra"

#: include/global_settings.php:434
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Mifototra amin'ny Fitaovana"

#: include/global_settings.php:440
