#: include/global_settings.php:485
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Alefaso ny Tarika sy Apetraka (Drag-N-Drop)"

#: include/global_settings.php:486
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Ny sasany amin'ireo seha-pifandraisan'ny Cacti dia manohana ny Tarika sy Apetraka (Drag-N-Drop). Raha voamarika dia halefa ity safidy ity. Fanamarihana: Ho an'ny mpampiasa manana fahasembanana ara-pahitana dia azo ajanona ity safidy ity."

#: include/global_settings.php:491
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Fiarovana ny tranonkala"

#: include/global_settings.php:496
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Terena ny fifandraisana handalo HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php:497
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, izay fikasana rehetra hiditra amin'ny Cacti dia havily ho any amin'ny HTTPS mba hiantohana ny fiarovana avo lenta."

#: include/global_settings.php:502
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Avelao ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra HTTPS tsy azo antoka"

#: include/global_settings.php:503
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Mamela ny fampiasana Taratasy fanamarinana voasonia tena (Self Signed Certificates) ary mamela ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano ao amin'ny Taratasy fanamarinana ho tsy mitovy amin'ny an'ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra."

#: include/global_settings.php:508
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Avelao ny tarehintsoratra manokana tsy azo antoka ao amin'ny Fomba Fampidirana Angona"

#: include/global_settings.php:509
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Ara-tantara, ny mpitantana ny Cacti dia namorona Fomba Fampidirana Angona tsotra izay ahitana baiko toy ny \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" mba hanehoana sanda isa ampiasaina amin'ny Kisarin'ny Cacti. Tamin'ny kinovan'ny Cacti taloha dia navela izany. Na izany aza, fanao tsy azo antoka izany satria vavahady ahafahan'ny mpampiasa avy any ivelany mamoaka Lasitra Angona tsy azo antoka. Ao amin'ny Cacti maoderina dia tokony hialana ny fanao toy izany. Na izany aza, manolotra ity safidy ity izahay raha manana Fomba Fampidirana Angona taloha misy ireo Tarehintsoratra Manokana tsy azo antoka ireo ianao ary mbola tsy namadika azy ireo ho script eo an-toerana ao amin'ny lahatahiry 'scripts'. Rehefa tsy voamarika ity safidy ity dia feran'ny Cacti ireo tarehintsoratra manokana fomba shell toy ny famantarana teny notsongaina, ny fonon-teny miolaka, ny tsipika mijoro, ny backslash, ary ny backtick. Mbola mamela ny mari-pamantarana lehibe noho sy kely noho ny Cacti ho an'ny zavatra toy ny <path_cacti> sy ho an'ny masontsivana fampidirana, saingy raha tsy voamarika ity safidy ity dia izay ihany no fetran'ny fampiasana azy ireo."

#: include/global_settings.php:515
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Politikan'ny Script Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php:516
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Mifehy ny politikan'ny CSP script-src. Amin'ny Fomba Nonce, ireo Plugin Cacti izay mampiasa JavaScript anaty pejy (inline) dia tsy maintsy ahitana ny toetra nonce avy amin'ny fiasa anatiny ao amin'ny Cacti hoe 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Raha tsy izany dia hosakanan'ny mpitety tranonkala ireo script ireo. Amin'izao fotoana izao dia mamela ny fanaovana tatitra fotsiny momba ireo Plugin Cacti tsy mampiasa tsara ny Fomba Nonce ny Cacti. Amin'ny hoavy dia havelanay hanakana ireo plugin toy izany tsy hampiasa ny JavaScript anaty pejy izy ireo ny Mpitantana raha toa ka tsy mampiasa Nonce."

#: include/global_settings.php:519
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Avelao ny JavaScript anatiny tsy misy Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php:520
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Avelao na ny unsafe-eval na ny JavaScript anatiny tsy misy Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php:521
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Fomba Nonce - Tatitra ihany"

#: include/global_settings.php:525 include/global_settings.php:540
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI fitaterana fandikana CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php:526
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL izay andefasan'ny mpitety tranonkala (POST) ny tatitra fandikana CSP amin'ny fomba nonce-report sy nonce. Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa <url_path>/csp_report.php. Tsy maintsy ahitana tarehin-tsoratra URL azo antoka ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php:532
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Loharano hafa ho an'ny Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php:533
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Anaran-tsehatra (domain) sarahin'ny elanelana izay mahazo alalana idirana ivelan'ny lohamilina web tenany. Zava-dehibe izany ho an'ny mpampiasa misafidy ny hampiasa CDN na tranonkala mpampiantrano. Mety ahitana marika solon-tena (wildcard) ny loharano ohatra: *.mydomain.com, na protokoly, ohatra: https://*.example.com. Ireo Loharano hafa ireo dia tsy mahafaoka afa-tsy ny karazana Sary, CSS ary JavaScript ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php:541
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL izay andefasan'ny mpitety tranonkala (POST) ny tatitra fandikana CSP amin'ny fomba nonce-report sy nonce. Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa /cacti/csp_report.php eo amin'ny fototry ny fametrahana. Tsy maintsy ahitana tarehin-tsoratra URL azo antoka ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php:553
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Alefaso ny famoronana Kisary mandeha ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php:554
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa, ny Fanaovana ho azy ao amin'ny Cacti dia tsy hamorona Kisary mavitrika mihitsy. Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fikirana Fitaovana mba hisorohana ny famoronana Kisary vaovao isaky ny mitahiry singa iray ianao. Mbola azo atao ihany anefa ny miantso an-tanana ny Fitsipika fanaovana ho azy."

#: include/global_settings.php:559
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Alefaso ny famoronana Singa anaty hazo mandeha ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php:560
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa, ny Fanaovana ho azy ao amin'ny Cacti dia tsy hamorona Singa anaty hazo mavitrika mihitsy. Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fikirana Fitaovana na Kisary mba hisorohana ny famoronana Fidirana anaty hazo vaovao isaky ny mitahiry singa iray ianao. Mbola azo atao ihany anefa ny miantso an-tanana ny Fitsipika."

#: include/global_settings.php:564
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Mailaka iantefan'ny fampandrenesana fanaovana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php:565
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Ny adiresy mailaka handefasana ny Mailaka fampandrenesana fanaovana ho azy raha tsy voafaritra eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotra fanaovana ho azy. Raha avela ho foana na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotra fanaovana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny kaonty mailaky ny Mpandrindra voalohany ao amin'ny Cacti ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php:571
