#: include/global_settings.php:1486
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Sanda Tsotra ho an'ny Mpanangona Angon-drakitra"

#: include/global_settings.php:1487
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Tazonina eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Mpanangona angona (Data Collector) ireto fikirana ireto. Sanda mahazatra ampiasaina amin'ny famoronana voalohany Mpanangona angona ihany ny sanda eto."

#: include/global_settings.php:1492
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Dingana fiasan'ny Mpanangona angona"

#: include/global_settings.php:1493
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny dingana miaraka atao amin'ny mahazatra isaky ny Mpanangona angona. FANAMARIHANA: Manomboka amin'ny Cacti 1.2, tazonina ao amin'ny Mpanangona angona ity fikirana ity. Amin'ny hoavy, sanda efa nomanina mialoha ho an'ny Mpanangona angona ihany ity sanda ity. Ny fampiasana isa ambony kokoa rehefa mampiasa cmd.php dia hanatsara ny fahombiazana. Ny fanatsarana ny fahombiazana ao amin'ny Spine dia voavaha tsara kokoa amin'ny alalan'ny masontsivana threads. Rehefa mampiasa Spine dia manoro hevitra izahay mba hampiasa isa ambany kokoa ka hifantoka amin'ny threads. Rehefa mampiasa cmd.php dia aza mampiasa mihoatra ny avo roa heny (2x) amin'ny isan'ny CPU cores."

#: include/global_settings.php:1500
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Threads isaky ny Dingana"

#: include/global_settings.php:1501
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ny Threads mahazatra avela isaky ny dingana. FANAMARIHANA: Manomboka amin'ny Cacti 1.2+, tazonina ao amin'ny Mpanangona angona ity fikirana ity, ary sanda efa nomanina mialoha fotsiny ity. Ny fampiasana isa ambony kokoa rehefa mampiasa Spine dia hanatsara ny fahombiazana. Na izany aza, ataovy azo antoka fa manana fifandraisana MySQL/MariaDB ampy ianao hanohanana ity kajy ity: fifandraisana = mpanangona angona * dingana * (threads + mpizara script). Tsy maintsy ataonao azo antoka ihany koa fa manana fifandraisana ambiny ampy ho an'ny fifandraisana fidirana ataon'ny mpampiasa ianao."

#: include/global_settings.php:1515
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Fomba fanamarinana maha-izy azy"

#: include/global_settings.php:1516
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Fanamarinana anatiny (Built-in)</i> - Ny Cacti no mitantana ny fanamarinana ny mpampiasa, izay ahafahanao mamorona mpampiasa sy manome alalana azy ireo amin'ny faritra samihafa ao amin'ny Cacti.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana fototra amin'ny Web</i> - Ny mpizara web no mitantana ny fanamarinana. Azo ampidirina na foronina ho azy amin'ny fidirana voalohany ny mpampiasa raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa modely, raha tsy izany dia ny alalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no hampiasaina.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana LDAP</i> - Ahafahana manamarina amin'ny mpizara LDAP. Hoforonina ho azy amin'ny fidirana voalohany ny mpampiasa raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa modely, raha tsy izany dia ny alalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no hampiasaina. Raha tsy mandeha ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP dia tsy hiseho ho safidy azo fidiana ny Fanamarinana LDAP.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana sehatra LDAP/AD maromaro</i> - Ahafahan'ny mpitantana manohana vondrona samihafa maro avy amin'ny lahatahiry LDAP/AD samihafa hiditra amin'ny loharanon'ny Cacti. Tahaka ny Fanamarinana LDAP ihany, ilaina ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP mba hampiasana ity fomba ity.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php:1522
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Manohana Cookies fanamarinana"

#: include/global_settings.php:1523
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Raha manao fanamarinana ny mpampiasa ary misafidy ny 'Tazony tafiditra aho', dia hisy cookie fanamarinana hoforonina ao amin'ny solosainan'ny mpampiasa ahafahany mijanona ho tafiditra. Tapitra ny fetran'ny cookie fanamarinana aorian'ny 90 andro tsy nampiasana azy."

#: include/global_settings.php:1528
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Mpampiasa manokana"

#: include/global_settings.php:1533
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Mpitantana voalohany"

#: include/global_settings.php:1534
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny kaontin'ny mpitantana voalohany izay handray mailaka ho azy rehefa sendra olana ny rafitra Cacti. Mba handraisana ireo mailaka ireo, ataovy azo antoka fa marina ny fikirana mailakao, ary manana adiresy mailaka voafaritra ny kaontin'ny mpitantana."

#: include/global_settings.php:1536 include/global_settings.php:1544
#: include/global_settings.php:1552 user_domains.php:394
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Tsy misy mpampiasa"

#: include/global_settings.php:1541
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Mpampiasa vahiny"

#: include/global_settings.php:1542
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiasa vahiny hijerena kisary; 'Tsy misy mpampiasa' amin'ny alalan'ny mahazatra."

#: include/global_settings.php:1549 user_domains.php:390
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Modely mpampiasa"

#: include/global_settings.php:1550
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiasa hampiasain'ny Cacti ho modely ho an'ny mpampiasa Web Basic sy LDAP vaovao; 'guest' amin'ny alalan'ny mahazatra. Tsy ho afaka miditra intsony ity kaonty mpampiasa ity raha vao voafidy."

#: include/global_settings.php:1557
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana fanamarinana fototra"

#: include/global_settings.php:1562
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Hafatra tsy fahombiazan'ny fidirana Basic Auth"

#: include/global_settings.php:1563
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa fanamarinana fototra, raha misy olana amin'ny fampifanarahana ny anaran'ny mpampiasa amin'ny kaonty Cacti manan-kery, dia ny hafatra ato no haseho amin'ny mpampiasa. Mety ahitana lahatsoratra sy HTML izany."

#: include/global_settings.php:1570
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Rakitra fampifandraisana Basic Auth"

#: include/global_settings.php:1571
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa fanamarinana fototra, raha mila avadika ho kaonty fidirana hafa ny kaonty fototra, dia azonao faritana eto ny rakitra CSV hampifandraisana ny kaonty fototra amin'ny kaonty fidirana irina."

