#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>FANAMARIHANA:</strong> Tafiditra ao amin'ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra ianao. Rehefa <b>'an-tserasera'</b> izy dia afaka mijery sy mifehy ny ankamaroan'ny Tranonkalan'ny Cacti fototra ianao toy ny hoe tafiditra mivantana ao aminy. Tsara homarihina ihany koa fa ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra dia takiana hampiasa ny endri-javatra <b>'Fanavaozana araka ny fangatahana'</b> ao amin'ny Tolotra fanatsarana fampiasan'ny Cacti, ary manoro hevitra hatrany izahay ny hampiasa Spine. Rehefa <b>'tsy an-tserasera'</b> ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra dia ho vitsy kokoa ny fampahalalana ao amin'ny Tranonkalan'ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra. Na izany aza, hitahiry vonjimaika ny fanavaozana rehetra izy mandra-pahatongan'ny Banky angon-drakitra sy Mpizara tranonkala fototry ny Cacti ho azo idirana. Avy eo dia handefa ny vokatra avy amin'ny tabilao Boost miverina any amin'ny Banky angon-drakitra fototry ny Cacti izy mba havaozina."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>FANAMARIHANA:</strong> Hatramin'izao dia mbola tsy nisy novolavolaina indray ireo Plugins fototry ny Cacti mba hiasa miaraka amin'ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra. Noho izany, ireo Plugins toa ny MacTrack sy HMIB, izay mitaky fidirana mivantana amin'ny fitaovana, dia tsy hiasa miaraka amin'ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra amin'izao fotoana izao. Na izany aza, ireo plugins toa ny Thold dia hiasa raha mbola ao amin'ny fomba <b>'an-tserasera'</b> ny Mpanangona angon-drakitra lavitra."

