#: lib/installer.php:2119
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Ny kaonty fidirana amin'ny tahirin-drakitra Cacti anao dia tsy manana alalana hiditra amin'ny tahirin-drakitra Faritr'ora (TimeZone) MySQL. Azafady omeo alalana \"select\" ny kaonty tahirin-drakitra Cacti ao amin'ny latabatra \"time_zone_name\" anatin'ny tahirin-drakitra \"mysql\", ary fenoy ny fampahalalana TimeZone an'ny MySQL alohan'ny hanohizana."

#: lib/installer.php:2124
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "Ny kaonty tahirin-drakitra Cacti anao dia manana alalana miditra amin'ny tahirin-drakitra Faritr'ora (TimeZone) MySQL ary efa feno fampahalalana TimeZone maneran-tany io tahirin-drakitra io."

#: lib/installer.php:2129
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "MySQL - Fikirana"

#: lib/installer.php:2130
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Ireo fikirana fanatsarana ny fahombiazan'ny MySQL ireo dia hanampy ny rafitra Cacti anao hiasa tsara kokoa sy tsy hisy olana mandritra ny fotoana maharitra."

#: lib/installer.php:2132
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana fari-drafitra MySQL atoro"

#: lib/installer.php:2161
msgid "Installation Type"
msgstr "Karazam-pametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php:2167
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Fanavaozana avy amin'ny <strong>%s</strong> mankany amin'ny <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php:2169
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Raha sendra misy olana dia atoro mafy ny fanadiovana ny fitadidian'ny mpitety tranonkalanao (cache), fanakatonana ary fanokafana indray ny mpitety tranonkala (fa tsy ilay vakizoro misy ny Cacti fotsiny) ary fanandramana indray, alohan'ny handefasana tatitra olana any amin'ny The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php:2170
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Amin'ny tranga mahalana dia nahazo tatitra avy amin'ny mpampiasa izahay fa sendra olana madinika noho ny fiovana tao amin'ny kaody. Ireo olana ireo dia vokatry ny fihazonan'ny mpitety tranonkala ny kaody talohan'ny fanavaozana, ary na dia efa nandray fepetra hampihenana ny mety hitrangan'izany aza izahay dia mbola mety hiseho izany. Raha mila toromarika momba ny fomba fanadiovana ny cache-n'ny mpitety tranonkala ianao dia toerana tsara hanombohana ny <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a>."

#: lib/installer.php:2171
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Raha mbola sendra olana ihany ianao aorian'ny fanadiovana ny cache sy ny famerenana manokatra ny mpitety tranonkalanao, azafady alefaso aminay ilay olana dia hiezaka izahay hamantatra ny antony nahatonga izany."

#: lib/installer.php:2177
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Fampidinana kinova avy amin'ny <strong>%s</strong> mankany amin'ny <strong>%s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php:2178
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Toa mampidina mankany amin'ny kinova teo aloha ianao. Tsy haverina amin'ny teo aloha ny fanovana natao tamin'ny tahirin-drakitra ho an'ny kinova vaovao kokoa ary <i>mety</i> hiteraka olana izany."

#: lib/installer.php:2183
