msgstr "Fampahalalana momba ny fifandraisana amin'ny tahirin-drakitra foibe"

#: lib/installer.php:2272
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Vakiana ihany ny fikirana!"

#: lib/installer.php:2274
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Ny rakitra config.php anao dia tsy maintsy azo soratan'ny mpizara tranonkala mandritra ny fametrahana mba hikarakarana ny Poller lavitra. Rehefa vita ny fametrahana dia tsy maintsy apetrakao ho Vakiana ihany (Read Only) ity rakitra ity mba hisorohana ny olana ara-piarovana mety hitranga."

#: lib/installer.php:2278
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Fikirana ny Poller"

#: lib/installer.php:2279
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Tsy mbola tafiditra ao amin'ny rakitra config.php anao ny fampahalalana momba ny Poller Cacti lavitra. Azafady jereo ny config.php.dist, ary apetraho ireo fari-tsanda: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, sns. Ireo fari-tsanda ireo dia tsy maintsy apetraka sy manondro miverina any amin'ny mpizara tahirin-drakitra Cacti Voalohany. Ahitsio izany ary andramo indray."

#: lib/installer.php:2283
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Fari-tsandan'ny Poller lavitra"

#: lib/installer.php:2285
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Ireo fari-tsanda tsy maintsy apetraka ao amin'ny rakitra config.php dia ahitana ireto manaraka ireto:"

#: lib/installer.php:2296
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Ny Mpametraka dia manome $poller_id ho azy ary manampy izany ao amin'ny rakitra config.php."

#: lib/installer.php:2298
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Rehefa voapetraka avokoa ireo fari-tsanda ao amin'ny rakitra config.php dia tsy maintsy omenao alalana hiditra amin'ny mpizara tahirin-drakitra Cacti fototra ihany koa ny $rdatabase_username. Araho ny fomba fanao mahazatra toy ny amin'ny fametrahana Cacti hafa. Afaka manindry ny bokotra 'Andramo ny fifandraisana' ianao avy eo. Raha mahomby ny fitsapana dia afaka manohy sy mamita ny fametrahana ianao."

#: lib/installer.php:2302
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Dingana fanampiny aorian'ny fametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php:2304
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Tena ilaina ny fahafahan'ny mpizara foiben'ny Cacti mifandray amin'ny alalan'ny MySQL amin'ny mpizara tahiry angon-drakitra Cacti lavitra tsirairay.  Rehefa vita ny fametrahana dia tsy maintsy manova ny Mpanangon-drakitra lavitra ianao ary manamarina fa marina ny fikirana.  Azonao hamarinina amin'ny alalan'ny 'Andramo ny fifandraisana' izany rehefa manova ny Mpanangon-drakitra lavitra."

#: lib/installer.php:2317
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Toerana sy dikan-tenin'ireo programa fototra manan-danja"

#: lib/installer.php:2318
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Ataovy azo antoka fa marina avokoa ireo sanda ireo alohan'ny hanohizana."

#: lib/installer.php:2321
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Toa misy lalana iray na maromaro diso, tsy afaka manohy"

#: lib/installer.php:2398
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Fanamarinana ny alalan'ny lahatahiry"

#: lib/installer.php:2399
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Hamarino azafady fa marina ny alalan'ireo lahatahiry eto ambany alohan'ny hanohizana.  Mandritra ny fametrahana, ireo lahatahiry ireo dia mila ananan'ny mpampiasa ny Mpizara Tranonkala.  Ireo fanovana alalana ireo dia ilaina mba hahafahan'ny Mpametraka mametraka fonosana Modely Fitaovana izay ahitana rakitra XML sy script hapetraka ao amin'ireo lahatahiry ireo.  Raha misafidy ny tsy hametraka ireo fonosana ianao dia misy script CLI 'install_package.php' azo ampiasaina avy amin'ny tsipika baiko rehefa vita ny fametrahana."

#: lib/installer.php:2402
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Rehefa vita ny fametrahana dia azonao ovaina ho famakiana ihany ny sasany amin'ireo lahatahiry ireo mba hampitomboana ny fiarovana."

#: lib/installer.php:2404
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ireo lahatahiry ireo dia mila mijanona ho azo vakiana sy soratana aorian'ny fametrahana mba hahafahan'ny fizotry ny fampifanarahana lavitra an'ny Cacti manavao azy ireo rehefa miova ny Tranonkala Foiben'ny Cacti"

#: lib/installer.php:2408
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Raha mametraka fonosana ianao, rehefa tafapetraka ireo fonosana dia tokony haverinao ho famakiana ihany ny lahatahiry scripts satria miteraka loza ara-piarovana ho an'ny tranonkala izany."

#: lib/installer.php:2410
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ho an'ireo poller lavitra dia tena ilaina ny hananan'ireo lalana izay havaozinao matetika, anisan'izany ny lalana plugins, scripts, ary resources, alalana famakiana/fanoratana satria tsy maintsy manavao ireo lalana ireo avy amin'ny votoatin'ny mpizara tranonkala foibe ny mpanangon-drakitra."

#: lib/installer.php:2416
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Tsy maintsy azo soratana mandritra ny fametrahana ihany"

#: lib/installer.php:2435 lib/installer.php:2468 lib/installer.php:2476
#: package_import.php:633
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Tsy azo soratana"

#: lib/installer.php:2447
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Tsy maintsy azo soratana aorian'ny fahavitan'ny fametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php:2487
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Mety hisy olana momba ny alalana"

#: lib/installer.php:2496
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Ataovy azo antoka azafady fa manana alalana famakiana/fanoratana amin'ireo lahatahiry cacti izay mampiseho hadisoana eto ambany ny mpizara tranonkalanao."

#: lib/installer.php:2499
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Raha mandeha amin'ny mpizaranao ny SELinux dia azonao atao na ny manafoana azy tanteraka, na ny manafoana azy vonjimaika ary avy eo manampy ny alalana mifanaraka amin'izany amin'ny alalan'ny fitaovana tsipika baiko SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php:2508
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Tokony hanana alalana MODIFY ny mpampiasa '%s' mba ahafahana mamaky/manoratra."

#: lib/installer.php:2517
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Aseho eto ny ohatra iray amin'ny fametrahana ny alalan'ny lahatahiry, na dia mety mila manitsy izany ianao arakaraka ny rafitra fiasanao, ny kaonty mpampiasa ary ny alalana irina."

#: lib/installer.php:2518
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "OHATRA:"

#: lib/installer.php:2519
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Rehefa vita ny fametrahana dia tokony hapetraka ho famakiana ihany ny lalana CSRF."

#: lib/installer.php:2521
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Azo soratana avokoa ny lahatahiry rehetra"

#: lib/installer.php:2533
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Fiarovana amin'ny alalan'ny lisitra fotsy fanamarinana ny fampidirana"

#: lib/installer.php:2534
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Ireo fomba fampidirana angon-drakitra Cacti izay miantso script dia azo hararaotina ka ahafahan'ny olona tsy mpitantana manimba ny rakitra an'ny kaonty poller, ary raha misy mampandeha ny poller Cacti amin'ny alalan'ny root, dia mety hanimba ny rafitra fiasa ka hamela ny mpanafika hanararaotra ny fotodrafitrasanao."

#: lib/installer.php:2535
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Noho izany, dikan-teny maromaro lasa izay, dia nohatsaraina ny Cacti mba hanome fahafahana mampiasa Lisitra fotsy amin'ireo karazana Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra ireo.  Na dia miaro kokoa ny Cacti aza izany dia mampitombo ny asa takina amin'ny mpitantana ny Cacti amin'ny fanafarana sy fitantanana Modely sy Fonosana."

#: lib/installer.php:2536
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Ny fomba fiasan'ny Lisitra fotsy dia rehefa manafatra Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra sambany ianao, na manafatra indray Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra, ka miova na amin'ny fomba ahoana na amin'ny fomba ahoana ny script sy/na ny mason-tsivana, dia hajanona avy hatrany ilay Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra sy ny Loharanon-drakitra rehetra mifanaraka aminy mandra-panamarinan'ny mpitantana fa manan-kery ilay Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra."

#: lib/installer.php:2537
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Mba hanamorana ny famantarana ny Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra ao anatin'izany toe-javatra izany, dia nanome script fanamarinana ao amin'ny lahatahiry CLI an'ny Cacti izahay izay azo alefa miaraka amin'ireto safidy ireto:"

#: lib/installer.php:2541
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Ity safidin'ny script ity dia hikaroka izay Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra voarara amin'izao fotoana izao ary hanome ny antsipiriany momba ny antony."

#: lib/installer.php:2542
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Ity safidin'ny script ity dia manala ny fandrarana ireo Fomba Fampidirana Angon-drakitra voarara amin'izao fotoana izao."

#: lib/installer.php:2543
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Ity safidin'ny script ity dia hamerina hampandeha izay Loharanon-drakitra najanona."

#: lib/installer.php:2547
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed."
msgstr "Tena soso-kevitra mafy ny hanavaozanao ny config.php mba hampandehanana ity fiasa ity amin'ny fanesorana ny marika fanehoan-kevitra eo amin'ny fiova <b>$input_whitelist</b> ary avy eo mandefa ireo safidy telo amin'ny script CLI etsy ambony rehefa vita ny fametrahana amin'ny alalan'ny tranonkala."

#: lib/installer.php:2549
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Tsindrio ny efajoro famantarana eto ambany hanamarinana fa efa namaky sy mahazo ity ahiahy ara-piarovana ity ianao"

#: lib/installer.php:2551
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Efa novakiako ity fanambarana ity"

#: lib/installer.php:2567 lib/installer.php:2573
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Profil mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php:2568
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources.  This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host.  Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Safidio azafady ny Profilan'ny Loharanon-drakitra mahazatra hampiasaina amin'ny fanangonana loharano.  Io no elanelam-potoana fara fahabetsany eo anelanelan'ny fitarafana fitaovana hahazoana vaovao ka arakaraka ny haha-fohy ny elanelam-potoana fanangonana no hitomboan'ny asa miantraika amin'ny mpizara Cacti.  Safidio ihany koa ny elanelam-potoana Cron kasaina, na efa voarindra, tianao hampiasaina amin'ny Fanangonana Angon-drakitra."

#: lib/installer.php:2579
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana Cron"

#: lib/installer.php:2600
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Tambajotra fandeha ho azy mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php:2601
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Afaka mitarika fitarafana ho azy ny tambajotra ny Cacti rehefa vita ny fametrahana. Hampiasa ny sahan'ny tambajotra eto ambany izany mba hamaritana ny sahan'ny IP azo tarafina.  Misy safidy voafaritra mialoha natao ho an'ny fitarafana izay ahitana ny fampiasana ny vondrona 'public' sy 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php:2602
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Raha mitaky safidy samy hafa hampiasaina voalohany ny fitaovanao dia azonao faritana eto ambany izany ary hampiasaina alohan'ny safidy mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php:2603
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Azo ahitsy avokoa ny safidy rehetra aorian'ny fametrahana"

#: lib/installer.php:2607
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Safidy mahazatra"

#: lib/installer.php:2611
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Fomba fitarafana"

#: lib/installer.php:2616
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Sahan'ny tambajotra"

#: lib/installer.php:2622
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Safidy mahazatra fanampiny"

#: lib/installer.php:2643
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Safidy SNMP fanampiny"

#: lib/installer.php:2656
msgid "Error Locating Profiles"
msgstr "Hadisoana teo am-pitadiavana ny profil"

#: lib/installer.php:2657
msgid "The installation cannot continue because no profiles could be found."
msgstr "Tsy afaka mitohy ny fametrahana satria tsy nisy profil hita."

#: lib/installer.php:2658
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "Mety hitranga izany raha manana tahiry angon-drakitra foana ianao ary mbola tsy nanafatra ny rakitra cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php:2666
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Fametrahana modely"

#: lib/installer.php:2669
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
